le>  <line class=\"radius-line\" x1=\"300\" y1=\"169\" x2=\"445\" y2=\"150\"></line> <line class=\"radius-line\" x1=\"300\" y1=\"169\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"-200\"></line> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"360\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"325\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">sen θ</text> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"282\" y=\"187\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">O</text> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"282\" y=\"9\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">y</text> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"450\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">P</text> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"425\" y=\"187\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">Q</text> <text class=\"atlasTextRadius\" x=\"520\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"1.3em\" font-weight=\"bold\">x</text></svg></div></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Gráfico 6</b>: Caso limite: enquanto o raio cai em direção ao eixo x, sen θ se aproxima de 0 e a cossecante cresce tanto que seu rótulo sai da figura.</p>",
